units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
lattice fcc 3.52
region box block 0 10 0 10 0 10 units lattice
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 58.6934
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Ni
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step temp press pe ke etotal vol
timestep 0.001
variable Trange equal 2500 - 300
variable heatTime equal v_Trange/10
reset_timestep 0
velocity all create 600 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix 1 all npt temp 300 2500 0.1 iso 1.01325 1.01325 1
variable nsteps equal ceil(v_heatTime/0.001)
run v_nsteps
